in 2021 and 2022\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Vaccination activities, coverage data, and performance indicators were reviewed and tabulated by region and by vaccination modality.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Postcampaign surveys are conducted by independent, trained personnel who select households by purposive sampling\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Vaccine dose histories reported by caregivers and collected during AFP investigations were reviewed and analyzed among children with confirmed WPV1 cases.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The expected background NPAFP rate is two or more cases per 100,000 children aged <15 years per year\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}